{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18260430","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18260430","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1826043001:1":{"text":"月弯街还是这么繁华又喧闹。","source_cn":"月弯街还是这么繁华又喧闹。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x654D456F3D91656B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1826043002:1":{"text":"听闻前阵子街上发生了爆炸，连我们的禁卫军长官格瑞泽尔勒都因此重伤，恐怕波及范围不小吧？","source_cn":"听闻前阵子街上发生了爆炸，连我们的禁卫军长官格瑞泽尔勒...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x0AAA8FAA39D73C7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1826043003:1":{"text":"现在情况如何？事故原因的调查结果有了吗？","source_cn":"现在情况如何？事故原因的调查结果有了吗？","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x8DB11B0E06F179CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1826043004:1":{"text":"抱歉，我并不负责相关事务，因此不清楚。","source_cn":"抱歉，我并不负责相关事务，因此不清楚。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xA1A252BB2F5A4589","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1826043005:1":{"text":"连这种小事都不清楚，苔佩希小姐却派你来招待，该不会是想敷衍我吧？","source_cn":"连这种小事都不清楚，苔佩希小姐却派你来招待，该不会是想...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x332861A1D40EB384","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1826043006:1":{"text":"我不敢随意揣度领主阁下的用意。","source_cn":"我不敢随意揣度领主阁下的用意。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x57563D39D8F01198","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1826043007:1":{"text":"别紧张，忠心耿耿的蝙蝠。","source_cn":"别紧张，忠心耿耿的蝙蝠。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x32648A9DC4DD1050","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1826043008:1":{"text":"那么，你至少知道发生爆炸的事故地点吧？","source_cn":"那么，你至少知道发生爆炸的事故地点吧？","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x3309D1F9DFC21E3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1826043009:1":{"text":"带我过去，说不定我能为苔佩希小姐排忧解难。","source_cn":"带我过去，说不定我能为苔佩希小姐排忧解难。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x6A1940F99CC59384","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1826043010:1":{"text":"很抱歉，我不能这么做。领主阁下嘱咐过，您是骸骨之王派来的贵客，不能让您为诺珐斯操劳。","source_cn":"很抱歉，我不能这么做。领主阁下嘱咐过，您是骸骨之王派来...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x2E35FBB2ED7AC44F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1826043011:1